The design of the radioactive waste treatment facilities (hereinafter referred to as "treatment facilities") shall comply with the following provisions:
1.The treatment facilities shall be provided with such functions as fireproof, explosion-proof, and overflow collection;
2.The treatment facilities shall employ seismic-resistant design, to ensure the safety of equipment and structures;
3.The design of the waste treatment system, equipment, or component shall be able to suppress deterioration, prevent leakage, and reduce the volume of the waste;
4.Equipment used to detect the discharge of gas or liquid watse shall be provided.
